Assassins of Erenor look to Melisara, the fallen aristocrat and daughter of General Ribola who was hired to kill Gene for his mother's crimes. She is a symbol for completing tasks, and the skills of Shadowplay are attributed to her.

'''Shadowplay''' is a Utility [[Skill Trees|skill tree]] built around mobility skills and disables. It stacks Bloodthirst and spends it on Backstab attacks, and it has stealth, leaps and teleports to choose the moment of every fight. It also brings some crowd control and utility of its own, so it works with almost any other tree.

