{{TreeSkills|Shadowplay|combat}}

=== Passive skills ===
Passives cost 1 skill point each and unlock after you have spent the listed number of points in Shadowplay.
{{TreeSkills|Shadowplay|passives}}

=== Abyssal skills ===
The [[Abyssal Skills]] have to be unlocked through a questline and don't require skill points to be used.
{{TreeSkills|Shadowplay|abyssal}}

